{"path":"filesystem/filesystem_error/operator=","title":"std::filesystem::filesystem_error::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::filesystem::filesystem_error::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/filesystem/filesystem_error/operator=","section":"filesystem","kind":"page","summary":"Assigns the contents with those of other. If *this and other both have dynamic type std::filesystem::filesystem_error then std::strcmp(what(), other.what()) == 0 after assignment.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">filesystem_error<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> filesystem_error<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assigns the contents with those of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>. If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> both have dynamic type <code>std::filesystem::filesystem_error</code> then <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strcmp\"><span class=\"kw1154\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strcmp</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>what<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, other.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code> after assignment.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>filesystem_error</code> object to assign with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Typical implementations store <code>path</code> objects referenced by <span class=\"t-lc\">path1()</span> and <span class=\"t-lc\">path2()</span> in a reference-counted storage. As a result, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> usually share their <code>path</code> objects after assignment.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"filesystem","title":"Filesystem library (since C++17)"},{"path":"filesystem/filesystem_error","title":"std::filesystem::filesystem_error"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::filesystem::filesystem_error::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Assigns the contents with those of other."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Notes","note":"Typical implementations store path objects referenced by path1() and path2() in a reference-counted storage."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":79,"codeBlockCount":0}
